{"detail": {"templateUuid": "1d3695cd6b8f49c0ad78d15e62274e14", "projectUuid": "da2580c01ffc4ceaafb58ce60297fe6c", "name": "共同所有  HELD IN COMMON", "description": "午夜起，新划定的国境将穿过一对老夫妻住了四十年的房子。他们必须在封关前把生活用品搬到同一侧，否则家具、食品和个人物品都要办理跨境手续。\n房屋因特殊条款得以保留，年轻核验员前来完成物品清册。夫妻起初把它当成游戏，随后却慢慢计较起各自的椅子、收音机和生活习惯。眼看一个共同的家被自己变成两堆，核验员开始设法叫停。\n最后只剩一张横跨国境的餐桌——它比两个新国家都老，却必须在午夜前选择归属。\n三个人只能在拆开它与改变规则之间，寻找第三种答案。", "coverUrl": "/assets/c74db1e4d3a3ecb2.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/e8e55bce55444f06a4f0601a8aeddad6/d5386a03e49a04433d5d206836e205a650687158.mov", "snapshotId": 51127, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 7334677, "ownerUuid": "2a1734bce5ec4e538db751696a2327d1", "avatar": "/assets/6b5a4ecb8bebe0cb.webp", "nickname": "尾号4321", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 2, "tags": [{"id": 3062, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "LibTV·「X小时之后」AI短片黑客松", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3062/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "7.17 复制打开抖音，看看【十歪的作品】共同所有 HELD IN COMMON 午夜起，新... https://v.douyin.com/avdqUY0_wIA/ :4pm 05/26 y@T.yG rre:/", "createAt": "2026年09月30日 14:01", "updateAt": "2026年09月30日 14:16", "publishAt": "2026年09月30日 14:01", "playCount": 105, "viewCreationProcessCount": 21, "copyCanvasCount": 6, "shareCount": 3, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/1d3695cd6b8f49c0ad78d15e62274e14.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 559, "edges": 1011}}, "recommendList": []}